OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmostly dying out this evening although
OL,7,Fa few continuing across the far
OL,8,Fnorthwest. Otherwise becoming dry with
OL,9,Fclear periods and easing winds. Chilly
OL,10,Fin some sheltered glens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FChance of a light shower
OL,13,Falong the west coast at first,
OL,14,Fotherwise dry with bright spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Fin the morning on Thursday before rain
OL,18,Fspreads east in the afternoon and
OL,19,Fevening. Mainly dry on Friday, a few
OL,20,Flight showers. Rain likely on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
